"英伟达正在研发新一代开源 AI 模型系列 Nemotron 4，规模最大的模型预计至少拥有 1 万亿个参数，旨在与全球最先进的开源模型竞争。英伟达尚未确定发布日期，最终训练也未完成，员工认为该模型最早可能在今年秋末准备就绪。此举意在通过开放模型生态扩大 AI 应用范围，并推动市场对其 GPU 算力的需求。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsostkpq05iurohd30b8ubmy","originalUrl":"https://www.ithome.com/0/988/524.htm","publishedAt":"2026-08-11T14:54:16.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-11T14:54:16.000Z","discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-23t2ho","originalSourceName":"IT之家·人工智能","family":"outlet-115kagi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业格局与资本动向","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsostkpq05iurohd30b8ubmy","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-23t2ho","name":"IT之家·人工智能","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业格局与资本动向","reportSummary":"英伟达正在研发新一代开源 AI 模型系列 Nemotron 4，规模最大的模型预计至少拥有 1 万亿个参数，旨在与全球最先进的开源模型竞争。英伟达尚未确定发布日期，最终训练也未完成，员工认为该模型最早可能在今年秋末准备就绪。此举意在通过开放模型生态扩大 AI 应用范围，并推动市场对其 GPU 算力的需求。","reportEdition":"2026-08-10","reportKind":"weekly"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsoq4td202ghrohdxxsbd756","title":"英伟达循环融资达到新高度，黄仁勋是否过度出牌？","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-08-11T13:29:37.000Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsoq4td202ghrohdxxsbd756","https://garymarcus.substack.com/p/breaking-circular-financing-reaches"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsoq4td202ghrohdxxsbd756","title":"英伟达循环融资达到新高度，黄仁勋是否过度出牌？","originalTitle":"","summary":"英伟达股价在相关消息公布后小幅下滑，收盘报217.55美元，盘前略有回升。金融记者Holger Zschaepitz和曾预测安然倒闭的Jim Chanos均对英伟达的循环融资做法表示担忧。此